。","三嶽神社（新郷村西越）","野沢温泉 鷲の湯","野沢温泉 新郷温泉館","間木ノ平グリーンパーク","長慶天皇の墓","墓がある「崩」地区の名称は、長慶天皇の崩御にちなんでいるという説がある。"],"specialties":["清酒「キリストの里」","新郷黒飴","紅葉みそ","アマランサス煎餅","新郷漬物","山菜"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E9%83%B7%E6%9D%91"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"新郷村","wikipedia_revision_id":"110480057","wikidata_qid":"Q44548","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E9%83%B7%E6%9D%91","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}